# A three-group document shaped like a vehicle model: ungrouped faces land in the
# implicit "default" group, "Body" is a plain cutout material, and "Glass" carries
# the always_on_light option on its material so the group renders glowing - the
# resource-pack mechanism MTR uses to make a model group glow. The Glass material
# also sets flipv, so the both-flips case can pin that the two flips cancel.

usemtl plain
v 0.0 0.0 0.0
v 1.0 0.0 0.0
v 0.5 1.0 0.0
vt 0.0 0.25
vt 1.0 0.25
vt 0.5 0.75
f 1/1 2/2 3/3

g Body
usemtl body
v 2.0 0.0 0.0
v 3.0 0.0 0.0
v 2.5 1.0 0.0
vt 0.0 0.25
vt 1.0 0.25
vt 0.5 0.75
f 4/4 5/5 6/6

g Glass
usemtl glass#always_on_light,flipv=1
v 4.0 0.0 0.0
v 5.0 0.0 0.0
v 4.5 1.0 0.0
vt 0.0 0.25
vt 1.0 0.25
vt 0.5 0.75
f 7/7 8/8 9/9
